@* 3. BENTO FEATURE GRID *@
<section class="lp-bento" id="features">
    <div class="lp-bento-header">
        <p class="lp-bento-eyebrow">Core Modules</p>
        <h2 class="lp-bento-title">Everything your HR team needs.</h2>
        <p class="lp-bento-sub">Six integrated modules covering the full employee lifecycle &mdash; from onboarding to shift scheduling.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="lp-bento-grid">
        <div class="lp-bento-card lp-bento-card-dark lp-bento-span-2" style="animation: lpFadeUp 0.6s ease-out 0.1s both;">
            <span class="material-icons-round lp-bento-icon lp-bento-icon-dark">badge</span>
            <h3>Employee Management</h3>
            <p>4-step onboarding wizard &mdash; personal, employment, banking &amp; statutory details. Searchable directory with tabbed profiles, bulk import, and org chart view.</p>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">Onboarding</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">Profiles</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">Banking</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-bento-card lp-bento-card-accent" style="animation: lpFadeUp 0.6s ease-out 0.15s both;">
            <span class="material-icons-round lp-bento-icon lp-bento-icon-accent">schedule</span>
            <h3>Time &amp; Attendance</h3>
            <p>Daily timesheets, clock-in/out, status filters &mdash; present, late, absent, on-leave, remote. Worked-hours computation built in.</p>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">Clock-in</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">Timesheets</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-bento-card lp-bento-card-light" style="animation: lpFadeUp 0.6s ease-out 0.2s both;">
            <span class="material-icons-round lp-bento-icon lp-bento-icon-light">event_available</span>
            <h3>Leave Management</h3>
            <p>One-click approve/reject. Configurable leave types. Country-aware public holiday calendar.</p>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">Approvals</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">Holidays</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-bento-card lp-bento-card-light" style="animation: lpFadeUp 0.6s ease-out 0.25s both;">
            <span class="material-icons-round lp-bento-icon lp-bento-icon-light" style="background:rgba(232,93,117,0.08);color:#e85d75;">view_timeline</span>
            <h3>Shift Scheduling</h3>
            <p>Department &times; shift matrix with day-of-week bitmask. Morning, mid &amp; night rotations with weekly coverage view.</p>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">Rotations</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">Coverage</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-bento-card lp-bento-card-dark lp-bento-span-2" style="animation: lpFadeUp 0.6s ease-out 0.3s both;">
            <span class="material-icons-round lp-bento-icon lp-bento-icon-dark">security</span>
            <h3>Security &amp; Audit</h3>
            <p>Configurable MFA, SSO, IP allowlist, session timeout. Full audit log of every user-management action &mdash; export for SOC2 &amp; ISO 27001 evidence.</p>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">MFA</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">SSO</span>
            <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-dark">Audit Trail</span>
        </div>
        <div class="lp-bento-card lp-bento-card-light" style="grid-column: 1 / -1; animation: lpFadeUp 0.6s ease-out 0.35s both;">
            <div style="display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
                <span class="material-icons-round" style="display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:24px;background:rgba(216,156,17,0.08);border-radius:14px;color:#d89c11;width:48px;height:48px;flex-shrink:0;">analytics</span>
                <div style="flex:1;min-width:200px;">
                    <h3 style="font-size:18px;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:8px;letter-spacing:-0.02em;color:#2D1B69;">Reports &amp; Analytics</h3>
                    <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#5B3A9E;margin:0;">Headcount growth, department distribution, attendance rate, leave utilization &mdash; all on a single dashboard with real-time KPI cards and exportable charts.</p>
                    <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">KPIs</span>
                    <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">Charts</span>
                    <span class="lp-bento-tag lp-bento-tag-light">Export</span>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>

